[version]
1.6.0
[date]
2026-10-22
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: Close button (X) now actually closes windows!
  - Old code set alive=false but didn't remove from list immediately
  - New code: removes window from state.windows list right away
  - Window disappears instantly when X is clicked
- FIXED: Logout now returns to GUI login (not text terminal!)
  - init.lua no longer falls back to tty after DE exit
  - GUI loop restarts, showing graphical login screen again
- NEW: Double-click on desktop icons to open apps!
  - Single click = select icon (visual feedback)
  - Double-click within 0.5s = launch app in window
  - Allows future drag-and-drop of icons (single click won't launch)
- NEW: Right-click on windows → context menu!
  - "Move to Monitor" — send window to attached Monitor block
  - "Minimize" — minimize to taskbar
  - "Maximize/Restore" — toggle fullscreen
  - "Close" — close the window
  - Click outside menu to dismiss
- NEW: Window "Move to Monitor" in context menu
  - If monitor is attached, sends window output to it
  - Click again to bring window back to main screen
  - This replaces the separate monitor-cast program for windows
- GUI now properly handles context menu rendering and clicks
[/whatsnew]
[files]
de/gui.lua
sbin/init.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
